WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.532
Susie worked on a jigsaw puzzle in her kitchen.

2
00:00:09.533 --> 00:00:14.648
"Meow!" Her cat pawed at the back door.

3
00:00:14.649 --> 00:00:19.224
"You can't go outside right now, Snowball," said Susie.

4
00:00:19.225 --> 00:00:23.221
"Meow!" Snowball pawed some more.

5
00:00:23.222 --> 00:00:27.399
"Not right now, Snowball," said Susie.

6
00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:29.841
"You just had a haircut and—"

7
00:00:29.842 --> 00:00:35.895
"MEOW!" Suddenly Snowball grew sharp fangs and spiky hair.

8
00:00:35.896 --> 00:00:40.843
Phwoof! She spit out a flaming hairball.

9
00:00:40.844 --> 00:00:42.825
Smoke filled the kitchen.

10
00:00:42.826 --> 00:00:45.795
When the smoke cleared, the door was gone.

11
00:00:45.796 --> 00:00:50.168
And so was Snowball.

12
00:00:50.169 --> 00:00:54.184
*** "Sit, Max!" said Mara.

13
00:00:54.185 --> 00:00:56.791
"Sit!" Roxy and her friends were at Metro City

14
00:00:56.792 --> 00:00:59.874
Park. They were trying to train Mara's new dog,

15
00:00:59.875 --> 00:01:02.674
Max. But Max wasn't

16
00:01:02.675 --> 00:01:07.000
listening. "Max, you need to sit," said

17
00:01:07.001 --> 00:01:14.472
Mara. "Woof!" Max barked. Then he lay down and

18
00:01:14.473 --> 00:01:18.614
yawned. "Maybe sitting is too boring for Max," said

19
00:01:18.615 --> 00:01:22.829
Jack. "We should teach him some exciting

20
00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:28.023
tricks." Jack ran to a tree. "Max!" he called.

21
00:01:28.024 --> 00:01:32.635
"Come!" Max rolled onto his

22
00:01:32.636 --> 00:01:36.306
side. Terrell held out his hand. "Give me your paw,

23
00:01:36.307 --> 00:01:38.114
Max." Max sat

24
00:01:38.115 --> 00:01:41.032
up. "He likes this trick!" said

25
00:01:41.033 --> 00:01:46.446
Terrell. But Max just scratched behind his ear and then lay back

26
00:01:46.447 --> 00:01:50.621
down. Mara sighed. "This is

27
00:01:50.622 --> 00:01:54.782
hopeless. Max can't learn any

28
00:01:54.783 --> 00:01:58.090
tricks." Jack sat down next to Max and patted his head.

29
00:01:58.091 --> 00:02:00.920
"I'm sure Max can learn tricks.

30
00:02:00.921 --> 00:02:03.887
He just needs more time."

31
00:02:03.888 --> 00:02:06.487
Roxy scratched Max behind the ear.

32
00:02:06.488 --> 00:02:11.289
"Max is a good pet, Mara," she said. "He's just a bit—"

33
00:02:11.290 --> 00:02:14.349
"Boring," said Mara.

34
00:02:14.356 --> 00:02:18.139
"There's nothing wrong with being boring," said Jack.

35
00:02:18.140 --> 00:02:22.224
Mara frowned. "I want Max to be super."

36
00:02:22.225 --> 00:02:26.490
"Yeah! A super dog would be cool!" said Terrell.

37
00:02:26.491 --> 00:02:29.628
"Maybe we could get Rocket Girl to train Max.

38
00:02:29.629 --> 00:02:32.432
She could make him really super!"

39
00:02:32.433 --> 00:02:40.727
Roxy laughed. "I don't think Rocket Girl knows how to train pets, Terrell."

40
00:02:40.728 --> 00:02:47.279
"You're probably right," said Terrell. He patted Max.

41
00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:49.541
Roxy jumped to her feet.

42
00:02:49.542 --> 00:02:51.737
"I just thought of something, Mara!

43
00:02:51.738 --> 00:02:54.817
Max definitely knows one trick."

44
00:02:54.818 --> 00:02:58.892
"What?" said Mara. Her eyes lit up.

45
00:02:58.893 --> 00:03:04.050
Roxy looked at Max sternly. "Max, stay!"

46
00:03:04.051 --> 00:03:06.478
By now Max was snoring quietly.

47
00:03:06.479 --> 00:03:09.579
He didn't move at all.

48
00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:12.027
"See?" Roxy grinned.

49
00:03:12.028 --> 00:03:16.062
Terrell and Jack laughed. Mara frowned.

50
00:03:16.063 --> 00:03:21.910
Just then Roxy heard her watch beep.

51
00:03:21.911 --> 00:03:26.857
She moved away from her friends.

52
00:03:26.858 --> 00:03:31.458
"Mayor Bloom," Roxy whispered. "Is there a problem?"

53
00:03:31.459 --> 00:03:35.733
"There is a terrible problem, Rocket Girl!" cried the mayor.

54
00:03:35.734 --> 00:03:42.451
"Monster pets are running all over West Street!"

